      "note": "First project-side statement that materializes attacker-controlled stream state used by the bug. After `frame_sync_` has already matched the leading `0xff`, this assignment records the second sync/header byte of a candidate frame and admits the parser into `read_frame_`, which immediately seeds CRC bookkeeping from the current bitreader cursor.",
